    "number": "Theorem 1",
    "quote": "Under Assumptions 1, 2, and 3, for any delta>0, eta>0, and alpha = delta/r, the expected dynamic regret of BGD(T, delta,alpha,eta) for the one-point feedback model satisfies E[sum f_t(x_t)] - sum f_t(u_t) <= (7R^2 + RP_T)/(4eta) + eta d^2 C^2 T/(2delta^2) + (3L + LR/r) delta T, for any feasible comparator sequence"
